# Deliberately NOT ignoring dist/.
#
# Consumers pin a tag archive URL, e.g.
#   https://github.com/ishan-parihar/ecosystem-auth/archive/refs/tags/v0.1.0.tar.gz
# That archive is the repository at that tag, so it only contains a usable
# package if dist/ is committed. `prepare` rebuilds it locally, but a consumer
# installing from the archive never runs a build. This mirrors
# @ishan/ecosystem-core, which tracks dist/ for the same reason.

node_modules
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz
.DS_Store
